From 6fc39ae81c76acea8f5141a4ef284e33df2ff02a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 09:36:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mcp): link sustainable announcements to esdg.ntpu.edu.tw

new.ntpu.edu.tw/sustainable/news/<id> shows a not-found page; the
office publishes the same Strapi records at esdg.ntpu.edu.tw/news/<id>.
Each source now declares its public news URL base, validated as an
https ntpu.edu.tw URL. Existing rows get the corrected link as a new
version on their next run, so the old link stays in history.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FCgoUnzqQSfKjvqShB2hjh
---
 .../normalizers/announcement.normalizer.ts    |  3 +--
 mcp/src/ingestion/source-registry.ts          | 23 +++++++++++++++----
 mcp/src/ingestion/types.ts                    |  2 ++
 mcp/src/ingestion/url-policy.ts               | 10 ++++++++
 mcp/tests/integration/multi-office.test.ts    | 10 ++++++++
